n-cols-14"><div class="homepage-intro__featured-work grid grid-cols-2 span-cols-6 col-start-2 span-md-cols-14"><div class="homepage-intro__featured-work-column homepage-intro__featured-work-column__desktop"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/beef-production-in-brazil-has-been-the-largest-driver-of-global-deforestation-in-recent-decades" aria-labelledby="fw1" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=1200 1200w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=1200" alt="Featured image" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="630"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker"><span class="homepage-intro__new-tag">New</span> <!-- -->Article · 2 min read</span><h3 id="fw1" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">Beef production in Brazil has been the largest driver of global deforestation in recent decades</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">Most beef production in Brazil is to meet domestic rather than international demand.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Hannah Ritchie</p></a><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/the-rise-of-electoral-democracy" aria-labelledby="fw3" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=1350 1350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=2400 2400w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=2400" alt="Featured image for the article &quot;The rise of electoral democracy&quot;. Stylized stacked area chart of the expansion of voting rights over the last two centuries." loading="lazy" width="2400" height="1260"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker">Article · 12 min read</span><h3 id="fw3" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">The rise of electoral democracy</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">How elections spread, voting rights expanded, and political competition developed around the world over the last two centuries.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Bastian Herre, Esteban Ortiz-Ospina, and Lucas Rodés-Guirao</p></a></div><div class="homepage-intro__featured-work-column homepage-intro__featured-work-column__desktop"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/moores-law" aria-labelledby="fw2" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=1200 1200w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=1200" alt="Featured image for an article on Moore&#x27;s Law" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="630"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker">From our classics</span><h3 id="fw2" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">What is Moore’s Law?</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">Exponential growth is at the heart of the rapid increase in computing capabilities.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Max Roser, Hannah Ritchie, and Edouard Mathieu</p></a><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/hiring-writer-2026" aria-labelledby="fw4" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=1350 1350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=2400 2400w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/014e8530-1d3d-409d-136d-467639157700/w=2400" alt="featured image" loading="lazy" width="2400" height="1260"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker">Announcement</span><h3 id="fw4" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">We’re looking for a writer</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">We’re hiring a writer who can make the world’s largest problems understandable to our large Our World in Data audience.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Hannah Ritchie</p></a></div><div class="homepage-intro__featured-work-column homepage-intro__featured-work-column__mobile"><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/beef-production-in-brazil-has-been-the-largest-driver-of-global-deforestation-in-recent-decades" aria-labelledby="fw1" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=1200 1200w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/31b278f8-6814-47ba-54ac-73914f6aff00/w=1200" alt="Featured image" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="630"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker"><span class="homepage-intro__new-tag">New</span> <!-- -->Article · 2 min read</span><h3 id="fw1" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">Beef production in Brazil has been the largest driver of global deforestation in recent decades</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">Most beef production in Brazil is to meet domestic rather than international demand.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Hannah Ritchie</p></a><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/moores-law" aria-labelledby="fw2" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=1200 1200w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/bf38d1d7-bff6-459c-6bac-154dbc055500/w=1200" alt="Featured image for an article on Moore&#x27;s Law" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="630"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker">From our classics</span><h3 id="fw2" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">What is Moore’s Law?</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">Exponential growth is at the heart of the rapid increase in computing capabilities.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Max Roser, Hannah Ritchie, and Edouard Mathieu</p></a><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/the-rise-of-electoral-democracy" aria-labelledby="fw3" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=48 48w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=100 100w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=350 350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=850 850w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=1350 1350w, https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=2400 2400w" sizes="350px"/><img src="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG0N6HnOy8g/8bb8ce32-4bbc-487c-e8bf-4ca148339a00/w=2400" alt="Featured image for the article &quot;The rise of electoral democracy&quot;. Stylized stacked area chart of the expansion of voting rights over the last two centuries." loading="lazy" width="2400" height="1260"/></picture></div><span class="h6-black-caps homepage-intro__featured-work-kicker">Article · 12 min read</span><h3 id="fw3" class="homepage-intro__featured-work-title h3-bold">The rise of electoral democracy</h3><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-description body-3-medium">How elections spread, voting rights expanded, and political competition developed around the world over the last two centuries.</p><p class="homepage-intro__featured-work-authors body-3-medium-italic">Bastian Herre, Esteban Ortiz-Ospina, and Lucas Rodés-Guirao</p></a><a href="https://ourworldindata.org/hiring-writer-2026" aria-labelledby="fw4" class="homepage-intro__featured-tile"><div class="image"><picture><source srcSet="https://ourworldindata.org/cdn-cgi/imagedelivery/qLq-8BTgXU8yG